  "Description": {
    "Cost": 2344000,
    "UIName": "Fenrir",
    "Id": "chassisdef_fenrir_FNR-SPL",
    "Name": "Fenrir",
    "Details": "Named for the demonic wolf of Germanic myth, the Fenrir was less a traditional battle suit and more a mobile fire support platform. The trooper controlling the suit was situated inside a cramped \"cockpit\" and piloted the Fenrir like a small walking tank. The single, configurable turret mounted on the suit could accept a wide variety of weapon configurations and the Fenrir's sturdy, powerful legs could propel it to much greater speeds than the Sloth.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.896</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#2aad3b>Can only be transported by internal bays, can not melee, can not swarm.</b></color>",
    "Icon": "BA_Fenrir"
  },
